<h1>derangement</h1>
<p>
(algorithm)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="permutation.html"><em>permutation</em></a> of elements, where no element is in its original position.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="sort.html"><em>sort</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

